# Task - Ontology: Engine Analysis

**Priority**: 

* **ANALYSIS** Refer to the [Engine Profile](#pstats-results). Perform an analysis of the results. Identify potential bottlenecks and inefficiencies in the Engine. 
* **REVIEW** Use the [Review Template](#template-review) to complete an analysis of the presented Application Codebase based on the [Engine Profile](#pstats-results). Discuss the design and architecture of the Application. Do not implement anything; instead step back and examine the big picture. Focus on the logical flow of the Application. Suggest improvements, if applicable.
* **BUGHUNTING** If bugs are detected, **do not implement the solution**. Instead, open a new [Bug Report](#template-bug) for **User Review**.
